      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "真的非常感谢您！这是我的联络方式，大约半个月后我会来联络您的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "拜托了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "您好，或许......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "抱歉打扰了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "真的非常感谢您，我会在半个月后左右再来联络您的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "四个月后"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "text": "普罗旺斯！有你的信——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "来啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "是谁给我寄信呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "你看看这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "还记得那个地震的镇子吗？他们寄信过来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "他们......他们真的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "真的做到了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "......嗯，他们做到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "真的？真的判刑了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "我，呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "我没想到，我本来以为绝对不可能来着，你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "瞧你脸都哭花了，快擦擦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "呜......呃，谢、谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "普罗旺斯，你那段时间一直没回舰，就是去忙这件事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "差不多吧。稍微花了点时间......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "我都不知道......我、我还在那儿消沉，你却......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "......我真不争气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "别这么说，按理说，后续的事情确实不是我们能插手的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "这算是我的一点私心吧，没法就这么看着事情没个结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "虽说......现在有了结果，对于那些遭灾的人来说，也已经迟了.......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "哎，不提这个了！之后有空，我们再去那个老奶奶的墓前一次吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员",
      "text": "......我想在老人家的碑前放一些黄色的石头，就当是她养的那些小羽兽......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "text": "嗯，就这么办吧。老奶奶一定会高兴的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
